  "description": "The full 42-pair composition menu on cifar100/cifar_cnn: the union of run_all_compositions.PAIRS (18, development) and run_wave2_held_out.PAIRS (24, held out), both IMPORTED and not re-listed, against both committed attacks at seeds 42-46. Wave 1 runs first because all 5 CIFAR-10 LOW pairs are in wave 1.",
